+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project's cache eviction policy is LRU (Least Recently Used) combined with a 300-second time-to-live (TTL) window: entries are evicted based on recency of access, and any entry is automatically expired 300 seconds after being cached regardless of access patterns, ensuring predictable cache behavior and automatic pruning of stale data.
